	Virtual Account Ed, History

 08-28-92 V1.00

      ° First version & Release version. Everything is new features
	so I wont tell you them again, just take a closer look at the doc

 09-04-92 V1.01

      ° VERY NASTY BUG found, when you saved an account where you had
	changed the users name, the user couldn't log in to the bbs becouse
	AmiEx couldn't find the name! Fixed!! Puuh, sorry guys! I forgot to
	save the new name in the user.keys file! The new routine also cleans
	up the user keys file :)
      ° Bug fixed with the New Users Scan... I changed some things just
	before I released the first version and a bug slipped thru, but it
	now even works greater!!
      ° You can now specify a conf that no one can give access to ie a conf
	for only the members in your group or so!
      ° It now writes a line in the CallersLog file:
	Account Editing... SecLevel: 255 (AccEd) Where seclevel is the
	securety level of the person who account edited!
      ° You can view the log file within the program with the commadand LOG
      ° Many opening and closing with the user data file was removed to
	increase speed while accessing the hard drive, therefor Do not
	read/write the user data with another program when using Account Ed!
      ° Finaly: Take a look at the doc file for more info how to set the NEW
	CONFIG PARAMETERS provided in this new version! All external files
	are STILL compatible backwards :)

 03-27-93 V1.03 Major Update for /X 2.35+

      ° The program is now fixed for AmiExpress 2.30+
      ° Fixed bug then a board had more than 255 users my util freaked out
      ° Added in extra security checks so you now must have all users who
        should have access to account ed in a list
      ° Added in so the sysop can specify a time period when no one is
        allowed to use account ed, like between 24.00 and 08.00 for instance
      ° Added in compatibility with Virtual Quest (Questionary Door Helper)
        so you now only have to push a button to get the users answers while
        you are account editing that particulary user!
      ° Added in an extra help page inside the account editor for all commands
      ° Added in the new functions like users baud rate, top cps ul/dl ie
      ° Added in so you can give each preset an description so your cosysop
        knows which preset to give to different users!
      ° Code optimized and the preset file is NOT compatible backwards!

 04-05-93 V1.04 DeZign

      ° The layout of the account editor improved an redesigned
      ° Due to the sillyness of the /X standard of keys for different
	functions inside the account editor I have remapped the keyboard
	functions to be more easy to overview and so on
      ° Added the computerlist to the preset file for faster program start
      ° Added in one more option to each preset, Autorejoin conference!
	this functions is placed in the 5:th row from the left. Please
	look in the manual for more information.
      ° Documentation rewritten and freshned up a bit, hope you'll like it!
      ° Added in built in calculator which will help you adding bytes or
	subtracting bytes from a users account. It works on everything
	that has got with the users upload, downloads to do. These are
	the mathematic chars it can handle, +, -, * and / .. Try it!
      ° Finaly I've managed to retain the information with the last on date
	so now you can se then a user was last on
      ° Adding a new feature giving a rating on all users you browse through
	I'm not really sure yet if this rating is a fair one, haven't tested
	it yet on so much users, but as far as I can see I think it's pretty
	fair. It gives a user a rating number depending on how much he
	has uploaded, downloaded, written and called. If a user has a negative
	number I really think you should talk with that user!
      ° You can now press TAB when you have searched for a user and want's
	to continue searching. This goes for the New Users commands aswell!
      ° You can now press SPACE to reload a users account if you have
	changed something wrong in the account!
      ° Added in so you could choose an security level for seeing users
	passwords when browsing through the accounts. If you sets this to 255
	it means that only the sysop will se different users passwords, but
	the cosysops could se all other information about a users!
      ° Added in so you have to push a special button for showing a users
	password so no one beside you will see it by mistake! This function
	is toggable, so you can set the defualt, on / off. Press SHIFT+C
	to toggle a password. You can't edit a password when not displayed!
	This idea originaly came from Excelsior of Virtual! Thanx m8!
      ° Password option added to access AccED, wanted by It of Cryptoburners

 05-01-93 V1.05 OptimiZe made at the Gathering II in Norway

      ° Search for name routine fastened up around 500% I think,
	it should now be equal to the built in or even faster!
      ° Built in message writer to inactive users with a litle warning
	note which says that the user shall upload if he don't wan't to
	get deleted. Just press W and the Account Editor will write a msg
	to the user you are account editing!
      ° Printer output routine improved and is now faster
      ° Whole new routine installed, Messagebase cleaner which deletes all
	your old mail which users have recieved. Finaly there is a util that
	does that and this one also remembers which the last message you
	deleted was!
      ° You can now define in which colour the info in the account editor
	will be printed in, in the preset file.
      ° You can now delete a users questionary when you are editing the
	users account. It has password support so your cosysops don't
	mess up anything :) Inside the editor is the command D
      ° Rebuilt the Presets file again, but this time I've included all
	parameters for both Quest & Account ED which has been inside the
	source before and made it a lot easier to change in! Please
	consult the doc file to see how to upgrade your old Preset file
      ° Help page significantly improved, this time with all commands
      ° Built in the last command that now makes this door 100% Quest
	compatible, so from now on all sysop commands in Quest has been
	removed. Quest will from now on be shipped with Account ED in a new
	special Account ED Edition.
      ° A litle bug has been reported in version 1.04 of Account ED, then
	you saved a new users account several times. It has been fixed
	without my knowledge due to the new Search for User routines
      ° Give/Take conference access routine partly rewritten
      ° And as always code optimized, this versions source length is even
	shorter than the previous one and has got much more powerful commands
	that's what I call an update!

